WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Can you prove how work happened? Reconstruct the rule, consent, evidence, action and approval.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Bind the rule to its version.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Record evidence and consent.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Name each human approval.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Preserve action and timestamp.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
An audit trail reconstructs the decision.
